    "citation_verified": true,
    "_fixture_notes": "applicable_when narrowed to require mrp_candidates presence, matching research/NotebookLM/rule_engine.py's own check_rule_applicability for LM-X01 -- the bare JSON condition fired REVIEW on every single-MRP scan."
